  "disposition": "Producer and consumer: The old plugin registers ordinary Bevy material plugins for solid and billboard pebbles. The successor instead registers chunk-material plugins for those two types and a new vista tree card type, while other listed materials remain on ordinary plugins. The chunk plugin installs shared extraction and buffer preparation once and prepares each material type separately; pebble and vista types select instanced shaders. The vista card parameter x now carries card height rather than representation level.",
